{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41672","headline":"赠江南李偕副使 · 陈陶","name":"赠江南李偕副使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世禄三朝压凤池，杜陵公子汉庭知。\n雷封始贺堂溪剑，花府寻邀玉树枝。\n几日坐谈诛叛逆，列城归美见歌诗。\n从军莫厌千场醉，即是金銮宠命时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}